//   1. In S-mode and U-mode: UNIMP, CSRRW to time, M-level CSR reads/writes and MRET: stval 0 or
//     the 32-bit instruction; in U-mode also an S-level CSR read and SRET.
//   2. With C and D, FS=Off: C.FLDSP (0x2002) in S and U: stval 0 or 0x2002. FS is set to Dirty
//     afterwards.
//
